@page "/services"

<PageTitle>House Proud Cleaning Solutions - Services</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <h1>Our Cleaning Services</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
        Whatever the job, we've got you covered. Explore our range of residential
        and commercial cleaning services below.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🏠</div>
            <h3>Regular House Cleaning</h3>
            <p>Weekly, fortnightly or monthly cleans to keep your home fresh all year round.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🧹</div>
            <h3>Deep Cleaning</h3>
            <p>A thorough top-to-bottom clean, perfect for spring cleaning or a fresh start.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">📦</div>
            <h3>End of Tenancy</h3>
            <p>Moving in or out? We'll get the property spotless and ready for inspection.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🏢</div>
            <h3>Office &amp; Commercial</h3>
            <p>Flexible cleaning schedules to keep your workplace clean and professional.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🪟</div>
            <h3>Window Cleaning</h3>
            <p>Streak-free windows, inside and out, for a brighter looking home.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🛋️</div>
            <h3>Carpet &amp; Upholstery</h3>
            <p>Deep steam cleaning to remove stains, dirt and allergens from soft furnishings.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="text-align:center;">
    <h2>Not Sure What You Need?</h2>
    <p>Get in touch and we'll put together a cleaning plan tailored just for you.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Request a Quote</a>
</section>
